{"unit_id":"tag:00XL:proof","translation":"按如下方式证明伴随性（adjointness）：<MATH_0001>。因此，它是左伴随（left adjoint），从而是右正合的（right exact），见《范畴（Categories）》引理 <REF_0001>。我们已知层化（sheafification）是左正合的（left exact），见引理 <REF_0002>。此外，包含（inclusion）<MATH_0002> 由引理 <REF_0003> 是左正合的（left exact）。最后，函子（functor）<MATH_0003> 是左正合的（left exact），因为它是右伴随（right adjoint）（所对应的是 <MATH_0004>）。因此，该函子（functor）是左正合（left exact）函子（functors）的复合（composition）<MATH_0005>，从而是左正合的（left exact）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"adjointness","target_term":"伴随性"},{"source_term":"left adjoint","target_term":"左伴随"},{"source_term":"right exact","target_term":"右正合的"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合的"},{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合的"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合的"},{"source_term":"right adjoint","target_term":"右伴随"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"adjointness","target_term":"伴随性","context":"由态射集合双射证明的性质；暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"left adjoint","target_term":"左伴随","context":"第一个伴随方向；暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"right exact","target_term":"右正合的","context":"左伴随的性质；暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用《范畴》章；暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化","context":"复合函子中的层化操作；暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合的","context":"各组成函子保持有限极限；暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含","context":"层范畴到预层范畴的包含；暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"复合函子与其中一个因子；暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"right adjoint","target_term":"右伴随","context":"其中一个因子的伴随性质；暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合","context":"修饰函子复数的同一性质；暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"组成复合的函子；暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"三个函子的复合；暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
